# BadSector - site bazli HTTP istek hizi (request-rate) esigi override haritasi
#
# Format:  <host>  <limit>
#   <limit> pozitif tamsayi -> bu host icin 10 saniyelik pencerede istek esigi
#                              (haritada olmayan hostlar icin varsayilan: 20)
#   <limit> = -1            -> bu host HAProxy request-rate limitinden MUAF
#                              (engine/site bazli rate-limit modulu devrede kalir)
#
# Ornekler:
# yogunsite.com 500
# bakimdaki-site.com -1
#
# NOT: Bu dosya restart olmadan canli guncellenebilir:
#   bash scripts/haproxy-site-limit.sh set <host> <limit>
#   bash scripts/haproxy-site-limit.sh unlimited <host>
#   bash scripts/haproxy-site-limit.sh clear <host>
#   bash scripts/haproxy-site-limit.sh list
